<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Italian Cup quarter-final</p>
<p>first leg matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Cremona 1 Bologna 3 (1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Cremonese - Riccardo Maspero (38), Massimo Susic (77,</p>
<p>own-goal)</p>
<p>Bologna - Kennet Andersson (22, 90)</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,400</p>
<p>Juventus 0 Internazionale 3 (0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers: Ivan Zamorano (33), Paul Ince (77), Youri Djorkaeff</p>
<p>(89)</p>
